#. Description of the plugin
#: dealer-inventory-for-autoscout24.php
msgid "Show a car dealer's AutoScout24 stock on their own WordPress site: synced locally, fast, crawlable and fully styleable."
msgstr "Affiche le stock AutoScout24 d’un garage sur son propre site WordPress : synchronisé localement, rapide, indexable et entièrement personnalisable."

#. Author of the plugin
#: dealer-inventory-for-autoscout24.php
